␀␀␀␀␀ SRE 2.2.2 Copyright (c) 1997-2002 by Secret Labs AB ␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Compiled regular expression object.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀match($self, /, string, pos=0, endpos=sys.maxsize)
--

Matches zero or more characters at the beginning of the string.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀fullmatch($self, /, string, pos=0, endpos=sys.maxsize)
