--

Return an iterator over all non-overlapping matches for the RE pattern in string.

For each match, the iterator returns a match object.␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀scanner($self, /, string, pos=0, endpos=sys.maxsize)
